{"type":"text","timestamp":1794559135795,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf2816cffeGpkXLORrbflLE9","part":{"id":"prt_1d40f3fa1001Yqt1yanXqtausZ","sessionID":"ses_e2bf2816cffeGpkXLORrbflLE9","messageID":"msg_1d40f2c0d001JZ1xiBfuCDzH0K","type":"text","text":"T045 complete.\n\n## Files written\n\nSource reads (the four files the task names):\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/claude.mjs` — `loadClaudeSession` now reads `storePath` instead of `transcriptPath`, with a comment stating the read is the path the containment check resolved.\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/devin.mjs` — `loadTranscript` reads `storePath` instead of `transcriptPath`, same comment.\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/dsh.mjs` — reads `storePath` instead of `logPath`; `logPath` is kept as the `decodeSessionLog` name argument because the decoder picks the format from the extension.\n- `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/pi.mjs` — `diskResult` reads `guard.path` instead of `filePath`, same comment.\n\nDeclaration files (mechanical, not hand-edited): the added comment lines shift the declaration-map line mappings, so `VSR` fails its declaration check until the maps are rebuilt. I ran the sanctioned generator `node .skilled/hooks/shared/session-reader-declarations.mjs`, which rewrote the four `.d.mts.map` files (`claude`, `devin`, `dsh`, `pi`) and left every `.d.mts` byte-identical. T047 re-runs this and will find them `current`.\n\n`codex.mjs` has the same `readFileSync(transcriptPath, ...)` pattern but is outside this task's file list, so it was left alone.\n\n## Verify output\n\n`VSR` = `node --test .skilled/hooks/shared/tests/session-readers/*.test.mjs`:\n\n```\nℹ tests 92\nℹ pass 92\nℹ fail 0\n```\n\n`rg -n \"readFileSync\\((transcriptPath|logPath|filePath)\" $SR/claude.mjs $SR/devin.mjs $SR/dsh.mjs $SR/pi.mjs`:\n\n```\nrg exit=1\n```\n\nNo matches printed (exit 1 is ripgrep's no-match status).\n\nDeclaration state after the regeneration, for coherence:\n\n```\nSTATUS=OK session-reader-declarations: 20 file(s) current\ncheck exit=0\n```\n\n`git status --short` over the readers folder lists only the four `.mjs` and four `.d.mts.map` files. Nothing else touched, no git state changed, checkbox not ticked.\n\nNothing I could not do.","time":{"start":1794559131553,"end":1794559135795}}}
